      "content": "It sounds like you're going through an incredibly difficult and emotional time. Finding worth in a new reality can take time and may include small achievements and moments of joy, even if they're different from before. Have you considered speaking with a therapist or counselor who can provide support and help you navigate these feelings? Perhaps trying new activities that don't rely on your past abilities could help you rediscover what brings you joy and fulfillment.",
      "source": "target",
